From: Go7 port <go7-port@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:11:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] QS: add frontlight warmth slider beside brightness

The warmth level is published through persist.vendor.go7fl.ct and applied
by the frontlightd vendor daemon, which owns the LM3630A frontlight IC.
